OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fine and dry day with sunny
OL,6,Fspells, especially in the east.
OL,7,FCloudier over western hills, with a
OL,8,Fsmall chance of an isolated shower at
OL,9,Ffirst. Feeling warm in the afternoon
OL,10,Fsunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FGenerally dry overnight with
OL,13,Fsome lengthy clear spells. Chance of
OL,14,Fsome isolated showers at first across
OL,15,Fthe north. Otherwise becoming chilly,
OL,16,Fparticularly under clear spells in the
OL,17,Fsouth.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
